WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.870
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:14.140 --> 00:15.020
Save me!

3
00:16.280 --> 00:16.940
Hao.

4
00:17.510 --> 00:18.010
Qi Fengyin,

5
00:18.190 --> 00:18.800
go save him!

6
00:18.830 --> 00:19.720
Why should I care?

7
00:20.320 --> 00:21.180
Yuwen Hao got involved

8
00:21.180 --> 00:22.160
because of me.

9
00:22.560 --> 00:23.010
In the secret passage,

10
00:23.010 --> 00:24.080
if he hadn't protected me,

11
00:24.240 --> 00:25.580
I'd have had my heart ripped out and died

12
00:25.580 --> 00:26.710
long before you got there.

13
00:27.670 --> 00:28.750
He saved your mystical flower.

14
00:52.980 --> 00:58.860
♪Winds rise. Youth fades. Joy and sorrow turn to nothing♪

15
01:00.900 --> 01:06.860
♪Blossoms fade away. This fleeting life is but a dream♪

16
01:07.900 --> 01:12.140
♪Desire blinds my eyes♪

17
01:15.820 --> 01:23.380
♪Our paths now part, and I cannot make you stay♪

18
01:23.740 --> 01:30.500
♪If love is deadly poison, hate is a furnace that sears the heart♪

19
01:31.740 --> 01:38.380
♪What is devotion? I fool my heart and spin my own cocoon♪

20
01:39.580 --> 01:46.420
♪Anger, obsession, greed, resentment, and envy bring trials across lifetimes♪

21
01:48.020 --> 01:54.540
♪The past turns to dust. I regret nothing, though my love was misplaced♪

22
01:59.300 --> 02:01.100
[Blossom in Darkness]

23
02:01.100 --> 02:03.100
[Based on the novel "Blossom in Darkness" by Guo Guo]

24
02:03.100 --> 02:06.100
[Episode 5]

25
02:10.110 --> 02:11.560
Hao!

26
02:17.670 --> 02:18.300
Yamao.

27
02:19.020 --> 02:19.940
How are you still alive?

28
02:21.390 --> 02:22.330
Didn't Liangsheng kill you?

29
02:22.960 --> 02:23.970
He wanted to kill me

30
02:25.430 --> 02:26.340
but didn't go through with it.

31
02:44.100 --> 02:44.880
How did you know

32
02:44.880 --> 02:46.240
Lu Liangsheng wouldn't kill anyone?

33
02:46.550 --> 02:48.090
Because he had no ill intent.

34
02:59.670 --> 03:01.090
He took all the hair.

35
03:01.760 --> 03:02.690
He's gone to the Eerie Cavern.

36
03:03.810 --> 03:05.380
But he still needs one more man's hair.

37
03:05.380 --> 03:06.540
How can he go to the cavern now?

38
03:06.710 --> 03:08.060
If he needs only one more man's hair,

39
03:08.710 --> 03:09.970
why can't he use his own?

40
03:23.920 --> 03:24.620
Xiangxue,

41
03:26.360 --> 03:27.710
I've kept you waiting for 20 years.

42
03:29.800 --> 03:30.530
You've suffered so much.

43
03:31.480 --> 03:32.570
I'll get you out now.

44
03:42.360 --> 03:42.810
No!

45
03:43.670 --> 03:44.150
Don't!

46
03:45.580 --> 03:46.140
Liangsheng,

47
03:46.960 --> 03:47.690
please.

48
03:48.870 --> 03:50.260
Please don't do this.

49
03:51.360 --> 03:52.060
It's my fault.

50
03:52.870 --> 03:53.780
I was wrong, all right?

51
03:54.520 --> 03:55.600
Just put down the knife

52
03:55.920 --> 03:56.650
and step away from the cavern.

53
03:56.670 --> 03:57.850
I'll do anything you ask.

54
03:58.270 --> 03:59.370
You still need one more man.

55
04:00.480 --> 04:01.020
I'll kill one for you

56
04:01.520 --> 04:02.640
and help you save Xiangxue.

57
04:02.640 --> 04:03.010
Liangsheng!

58
04:03.210 --> 04:03.750
Liangsheng!

59
04:11.110 --> 04:11.740
Liangsheng,

60
04:12.990 --> 04:13.690
I want you to know

61
04:16.640 --> 04:17.450
I've never

62
04:17.470 --> 04:18.420
hated you.

63
04:20.680 --> 04:21.980
I went looking for the Moonlit Revival Herb

64
04:22.680 --> 04:23.810
to save your life.

65
04:25.000 --> 04:26.500
I trapped Xiangxue in the Eerie Cavern

66
04:27.440 --> 04:28.100
because I wanted

67
04:28.120 --> 04:29.210
to keep you by my side.

68
04:32.560 --> 04:33.690
But if you die,

69
04:35.320 --> 04:37.010
what's the point of any of this?

70
04:40.440 --> 04:41.100
Liangsheng...

71
04:42.760 --> 04:43.500
It's too late.

72
04:46.830 --> 04:48.660
You killed all those people,

73
04:50.390 --> 04:51.740
but I share the blame.

74
04:53.560 --> 04:55.060
I've been your accomplice for 20 years.

75
04:58.470 --> 04:59.620
Let my death

76
05:02.880 --> 05:04.010
put an end to all this.

77
05:04.790 --> 05:05.300
No...

78
05:09.440 --> 05:10.010
Liangsheng!

79
05:11.520 --> 05:12.300
Liangsheng!

80
05:14.640 --> 05:15.450
Liangsheng!

81
05:15.760 --> 05:16.540
Liangsheng!

82
05:16.910 --> 05:18.210
Please don't die.

83
05:18.830 --> 05:19.420
Liangsheng,

84
05:20.080 --> 05:21.210
I tried to make you kill

85
05:21.680 --> 05:22.300
because I wanted

86
05:22.320 --> 05:23.130
to drag you down with me.

87
05:23.230 --> 05:24.370
But if you die,

88
05:24.830 --> 05:25.500
what's the point

89
05:25.520 --> 05:26.430
of anything I've done?

90
05:26.660 --> 05:27.410
Liangsheng.

91
05:27.640 --> 05:28.420
Liangsheng!

92
05:30.710 --> 05:31.780
Liangsheng!

93
05:32.710 --> 05:34.160
I don't want anything else.

94
05:35.320 --> 05:36.690
I just want you to live.

95
06:18.710 --> 06:19.540
Xia Xiangxue?

96
06:28.880 --> 06:29.370
Liangsheng.

97
06:30.080 --> 06:30.620
Liangsheng,

98
06:31.080 --> 06:31.940
where are you?

99
06:32.710 --> 06:33.100
Why...

100
06:33.470 --> 06:34.770
Why can't I see anything?

101
06:35.910 --> 06:36.500
Xiangxue.

102
06:38.390 --> 06:39.010
Hexiang?

103
06:40.880 --> 06:42.740
Liangsheng waited his whole life for you.

104
06:44.880 --> 06:46.330
I could never win his heart.

105
06:46.790 --> 06:48.810
At least I can keep his body with me.

106
06:57.030 --> 06:57.810
She just passed out.

107
07:07.150 --> 07:07.570
Liangsheng,

108
07:09.640 --> 07:11.020
let's go into the Eerie Cavern together.

109
07:13.270 --> 07:14.060
Then we can

110
07:14.080 --> 07:15.190
be together forever.

111
07:18.320 --> 07:18.810
Su Hexiang!

112
07:21.480 --> 07:22.250
It's time to stop.

113
07:22.870 --> 07:23.460
Let him go.

114
07:24.000 --> 07:24.780
Let him go?

115
07:26.680 --> 07:27.900
What about all the love

116
07:29.240 --> 07:30.730
I've had for him all these years?

117
07:32.750 --> 07:34.220
You forced him to stay for 20 years.

118
07:34.950 --> 07:35.930
Were you ever really happy?

119
07:37.430 --> 07:38.900
You kept Lu Liangsheng by your side,

120
07:39.680 --> 07:41.900
watching him pine for Xia Xiangxue.

121
07:42.390 --> 07:43.580
Is that really what you wanted?

122
07:44.190 --> 07:45.700
You've been blinded by your obsession.

123
07:47.120 --> 07:48.460
Let his soul return to Heaven and Earth,

124
07:48.950 --> 07:51.250
and Lu Liangsheng may yet live again.

125
07:53.070 --> 07:53.370
Right.

126
07:54.040 --> 07:55.170
As long as his soul survives,

127
07:55.560 --> 07:56.220
there's still a chance

128
07:56.510 --> 07:57.580
to make amends for the past.

129
07:57.830 --> 07:58.410
Su Hexiang,

130
07:59.160 --> 08:00.220
don't make another mistake.

131
08:09.000 --> 08:09.660
Liangsheng,

132
08:13.240 --> 08:14.370
if I let go,

133
08:17.000 --> 08:18.140
you'll forgive me,

134
08:19.830 --> 08:20.370
won't you?

135
08:24.870 --> 08:25.610
Xiangxue said

136
08:26.390 --> 08:27.730
you injured your hands

137
08:28.680 --> 08:29.660
by pushing yourself too hard

138
08:29.920 --> 08:30.980
to master an immortal technique.

139
08:31.480 --> 08:32.010
Why does she

140
08:32.030 --> 08:33.130
tell you everything?

141
08:36.720 --> 08:38.060
You're gifted, Hexiang.

142
08:39.790 --> 08:40.300
If even you

143
08:40.360 --> 08:41.580
can't master this technique,

144
08:42.080 --> 08:43.530
few in the world could.

145
08:44.510 --> 08:45.580
This technique must be

146
08:45.750 --> 08:46.700
a bad match for you.

147
08:47.030 --> 08:47.730
Just stop practicing it.

148
08:52.080 --> 08:53.180
You're too stubborn.

149
08:54.000 --> 08:54.730
I'm worried

150
08:55.270 --> 08:56.580
you'll suffer for it someday

151
08:57.240 --> 08:58.610
and leave yourself no way out.

152
09:00.360 --> 09:02.130
You have to know when to let go,

153
09:03.120 --> 09:03.580
all right?

154
09:05.440 --> 09:06.060
Letting go

155
09:06.080 --> 09:07.180
isn't that easy.

156
09:13.550 --> 09:15.770
If I manage it,

157
09:17.150 --> 09:18.130
will there be a reward?

158
09:19.630 --> 09:20.010
All right.

159
09:20.670 --> 09:21.130
A reward.

160
09:23.600 --> 09:24.460
Then from now on,

161
09:24.720 --> 09:25.770
whatever mistakes you make,

162
09:26.390 --> 09:27.180
I won't be angry with you.

163
09:27.670 --> 09:28.130
How's that?

164
09:30.480 --> 09:31.850
What kind of reward is that?

165
09:33.080 --> 09:34.220
I don't make mistakes.

166
11:15.720 --> 11:16.460
So all this time,

167
11:16.790 --> 11:17.940
you couldn't reclaim your malice

168
11:18.510 --> 11:20.410
because it'd been tightly entwined

169
11:20.550 --> 11:21.930
with Su Hexiang's obsession.

170
11:39.440 --> 11:40.730
Su Hexiang's giving Xia Xiangxue

171
11:41.240 --> 11:42.370
her immortal core to make amends.

172
11:50.670 --> 11:52.250
This cavern is too sinister.

173
11:52.480 --> 11:53.730
I'd better seal it.

174
12:05.600 --> 12:06.250
Let her go.

175
12:18.910 --> 12:20.010
Your skills are lacking,

176
12:20.390 --> 12:21.340
and you're troubled by inner demons.

177
12:21.840 --> 12:23.180
That's why the cavern could affect you.

178
12:27.790 --> 12:28.940
Go back and train harder.

179
12:31.910 --> 12:32.700
One day,

180
12:34.630 --> 12:35.490
I'll kill you myself

181
12:35.490 --> 12:36.580
with my sword.

182
12:53.890 --> 12:55.980
I lied when I said I held no grudges.

183
13:06.410 --> 13:07.890
You told me

184
13:08.560 --> 13:10.300
if you ever lied to me

185
13:11.030 --> 13:11.820
or betrayed me again,

186
13:12.910 --> 13:14.890
I could flay you and tear you apart.

187
13:16.960 --> 13:18.890
Let's settle the score today.

188
13:33.240 --> 13:33.890
Master,

189
13:36.270 --> 13:38.300
I can't do anything right.

190
13:39.480 --> 13:40.250
Master,

191
13:42.200 --> 13:43.180
I'm so tired.

192
13:45.750 --> 13:46.460
Please

193
13:46.480 --> 13:48.220
don't leave me all alone.

194
13:50.200 --> 13:51.060
Master...

195
13:54.630 --> 13:55.250
Master...

196
14:04.840 --> 14:05.700
Master,

197
14:07.270 --> 14:08.180
I'm so cold.

198
14:18.910 --> 14:20.100
Isn't there a fire already?

199
15:36.390 --> 15:37.430
Ow!

200
15:37.430 --> 15:38.100
Ow!

201
15:38.100 --> 15:38.660
What?

202
15:38.790 --> 15:39.440
What's wrong?

203
15:40.260 --> 15:40.770
What's wrong?

204
15:40.960 --> 15:41.550
- You... - What's wrong?

205
15:41.550 --> 15:42.210
What happened?

206
15:42.360 --> 15:43.250
Youyou, how could you?

207
15:43.670 --> 15:45.200
You know I hate being in the sun,

208
15:45.320 --> 15:46.420
yet you left me baking in direct sunlight!

209
15:46.480 --> 15:47.250
- Listen... - In this heat,

210
15:47.270 --> 15:48.370
an egg would be cooked by now!

211
15:48.370 --> 15:49.330
Hey!

212
15:49.330 --> 15:50.570
Why are you yelling at me?

213
15:50.670 --> 15:51.730
His Lordship wanted

214
15:52.030 --> 15:53.140
to water the mystical flower,

215
15:53.140 --> 15:54.700
so he told me to put you there.

216
15:55.080 --> 15:56.290
I was kind enough

217
15:56.290 --> 15:57.100
to find you a leaf

218
15:57.120 --> 15:57.820
to give you some shade.

219
15:58.670 --> 15:59.460
You're not bald, are you?

220
16:03.720 --> 16:04.940
Don't go over there.

221
16:05.150 --> 16:06.250
You'll disturb His Lordship.

222
16:06.320 --> 16:07.770
He's busy

223
16:07.770 --> 16:08.580
condensing his malice.

224
16:09.000 --> 16:09.820
Condensing his malice?

225
16:10.870 --> 16:11.460
Really?

226
16:11.870 --> 16:13.220
Once he's watered the mystical flower

227
16:13.270 --> 16:14.140
and it blooms,

228
16:14.550 --> 16:15.490
I'll be free!

229
16:16.270 --> 16:17.340
You pushed His Lordship

230
16:17.340 --> 16:18.130
into the Eerie Cavern.

231
16:18.240 --> 16:19.100
What makes you think

232
16:19.120 --> 16:20.060
he'll set you free?

233
16:22.550 --> 16:23.850
We've been through

234
16:23.870 --> 16:25.130
a lot together, haven't we?

235
16:25.390 --> 16:26.010
Besides,

236
16:26.270 --> 16:27.650
he spared Su Hexiang.

237
16:27.790 --> 16:29.180
Why wouldn't he spare me?

238
16:30.320 --> 16:31.060
He was my Fengxian

239
16:31.080 --> 16:32.180
for a few days too.

240
16:32.550 --> 16:33.300
So, in a way,

241
16:33.300 --> 16:34.470
he answered to me.

242
16:35.250 --> 16:36.130
He should at least

243
16:36.130 --> 16:37.220
give me some credit, right?

244
16:54.010 --> 16:55.420
I was just joking with Youyou.

245
16:55.840 --> 16:57.100
I didn't mean any disrespect.

246
17:00.510 --> 17:01.730
Then why are you backing away?

247
17:02.840 --> 17:03.250
I...

248
17:13.640 --> 17:14.570
Are you going to water the flower?

249
17:16.510 --> 17:17.180
I'm ready!

250
17:18.400 --> 17:19.220
Let's agree on one thing first.

251
17:19.350 --> 17:20.220
I've helped you reclaim your malice.

252
17:20.240 --> 17:21.420
That counts for something.

253
17:21.880 --> 17:22.700
Once the mystical flower blooms,

254
17:22.720 --> 17:23.420
can we put our grudges

255
17:23.440 --> 17:24.180
behind us?

256
17:24.400 --> 17:25.090
I promise I won't

257
17:25.110 --> 17:25.570
get in the way

258
17:25.590 --> 17:26.380
of your happy life with her.

259
17:49.030 --> 17:49.620
That's it?

260
17:58.480 --> 17:59.090
Hao,

261
17:59.550 --> 18:00.380
how did you get hurt?

262
18:00.750 --> 18:02.090
Mount Leiguan's a mess too.

263
18:02.270 --> 18:03.290
What happened?

264
18:03.960 --> 18:05.010
Madam Su is dead.

265
18:07.590 --> 18:08.330
Has Master arrived?

266
18:08.680 --> 18:09.980
On his way here,

267
18:10.160 --> 18:10.810
Master sensed

268
18:10.830 --> 18:11.660
Qi Fengyin's dark aura.

269
18:11.960 --> 18:13.180
He and the other sect leaders

270
18:13.350 --> 18:14.420
have gone to intercept him.

271
18:15.880 --> 18:17.180
Hao, where are you going?

272
18:17.960 --> 18:19.050
You're badly hurt.

273
18:19.720 --> 18:20.730
To join Master.

274
18:21.510 --> 18:23.050
We can't just let Qi Fengyin get away.

275
18:26.640 --> 18:27.140
Didn't you say

276
18:27.160 --> 18:28.130
once you reclaimed all your malice,

277
18:28.130 --> 18:28.980
the flower would bloom?

278
18:29.030 --> 18:29.810
Why does it still look like this?

279
18:33.790 --> 18:34.620
Or was it

280
18:35.510 --> 18:36.620
only a wisp of your malice

281
18:36.790 --> 18:38.340
that latched onto Su Hexiang,

282
18:38.720 --> 18:39.830
just like the one

283
18:39.930 --> 18:41.410
Youyou had?

284
18:41.590 --> 18:42.750
You only just figured that out?

285
18:43.440 --> 18:45.250
Then when will we ever find it all?

286
18:49.750 --> 18:51.010
The man you keep thinking about...

287
18:51.830 --> 18:52.460
This must be

288
18:52.550 --> 18:54.180
what his soul turned into.

289
18:55.750 --> 18:56.620
When did you take it?

290
18:56.720 --> 18:57.770
While you were unconscious last night,

291
18:57.880 --> 18:59.460
you told me far more than you should have.

292
18:59.920 --> 19:00.460
I think

293
19:00.480 --> 19:01.420
holding on to this

294
19:01.720 --> 19:02.880
is worth more

295
19:02.880 --> 19:03.490
than all your promises.

296
19:09.960 --> 19:11.290
I know you want your malice back

297
19:11.510 --> 19:12.770
so this flower can bloom again.

298
19:13.000 --> 19:13.860
I can help.

299
19:14.480 --> 19:15.490
But you have to promise

300
19:16.510 --> 19:18.140
not to kill me and to return the soul crystal

301
19:19.000 --> 19:20.420
once you've reclaimed

302
19:20.590 --> 19:21.620
all your malice.

303
19:22.000 --> 19:22.530
Fine.

304
19:23.070 --> 19:23.900
You agreed so quickly.

305
19:24.440 --> 19:25.250
Do you really mean it?

306
19:27.960 --> 19:28.730
What could I possibly gain

307
19:28.750 --> 19:29.490
by lying to you?

308
19:29.830 --> 19:30.770
Wretched devil.

309
19:31.310 --> 19:32.420
Who taught him

310
19:32.440 --> 19:33.460
to be so sharp-tongued?

311
19:33.750 --> 19:34.660
Are you two done talking?

312
19:37.960 --> 19:38.490
Finally,

313
19:38.510 --> 19:39.980
it's my time to shine.

314
19:51.960 --> 19:52.530
What's this?

315
19:52.640 --> 19:53.940
It's my compass.

316
19:54.200 --> 19:56.460
It points toward murderous intent,

317
19:57.640 --> 19:58.980
so it should be able to find malice too.

318
20:07.960 --> 20:08.420
Got it.

319
20:08.750 --> 20:09.620
To the east.

320
20:09.920 --> 20:10.290
Wait...

321
20:10.480 --> 20:11.980
Can we trust this thing?

322
20:12.350 --> 20:13.010
Are you doubting me?

323
20:15.600 --> 20:16.410
Wait!

324
20:22.550 --> 20:23.010
Want some?

325
20:23.510 --> 20:24.140
I'm vegetarian.

326
20:30.790 --> 20:32.940
Did you go back to Mount Leiguan afterward?

327
20:33.720 --> 20:35.330
Su Hexiang was the sect leader,

328
20:36.070 --> 20:37.010
and I've never heard

329
20:37.030 --> 20:38.290
of her having a personal disciple.

330
20:38.640 --> 20:40.010
I bet Mount Leiguan

331
20:40.030 --> 20:41.220
is in chaos now.

332
20:41.510 --> 20:42.530
What's that got to do with me?

333
20:45.790 --> 20:46.770
After all the harm she's done,

334
20:47.480 --> 20:48.380
she brought this tragedy

335
20:48.400 --> 20:49.620
upon herself.

336
20:50.310 --> 20:50.980
Oh, that woman...

337
20:51.160 --> 20:52.530
I pity her, but I despise her too.

338
20:53.270 --> 20:54.460
You pity her?

339
20:56.640 --> 20:57.530
Those immortal jerks

340
20:57.550 --> 20:58.940
all think they're better than everyone.

341
20:59.550 --> 21:00.620
Having one of them fall for you

342
21:00.920 --> 21:02.420
is the worst luck imaginable.

343
21:03.790 --> 21:05.900
I've roamed this world for years.

344
21:06.000 --> 21:07.250
I saw through them long ago.

345
21:08.720 --> 21:09.660
My master isn't like that.

346
21:10.590 --> 21:11.940
And Xia Xiangxue,

347
21:12.000 --> 21:12.530
Su Hexiang's senior sister,

348
21:12.720 --> 21:13.380
isn't like that either.

349
21:15.750 --> 21:16.330
Qi Fengyin,

350
21:16.680 --> 21:17.180
what do you think?

351
21:17.310 --> 21:18.420
You've lived even longer than Youyou.

352
21:18.510 --> 21:19.490
You must have seen more, right?

353
21:22.590 --> 21:23.490
I've long forgotten

354
21:23.510 --> 21:24.530
what happened 1,000 years ago.

355
21:39.030 --> 21:39.810
You said

356
21:40.030 --> 21:41.900
the mystical flower was someone's spirit.

357
21:42.200 --> 21:43.030
Whose is it?

358
21:43.240 --> 21:44.420
Is it someone you're in love with?

359
21:44.920 --> 21:48.280
Is she your wife, My Lord?

360
21:48.280 --> 21:49.010
No way.

361
21:49.400 --> 21:50.420
If she were his wife,

362
21:50.510 --> 21:51.450
there'd definitely be

363
21:51.450 --> 21:52.240
some record of her.

364
21:52.640 --> 21:55.460
Could it be someone he secretly loves?

365
21:55.790 --> 21:57.420
What kind of person could matter more to him

366
21:57.440 --> 21:58.460
than his own life?

367
22:01.110 --> 22:02.530
How do you think

368
22:02.550 --> 22:03.620
she ended up like this?

369
22:04.110 --> 22:06.490
Did the Saintess of the Tides do this to her?

370
22:12.160 --> 22:13.050
Any more questions?

371
22:13.920 --> 22:14.810
You'd better ask them now.

372
22:15.350 --> 22:16.530
We have no more questions!

373
22:33.590 --> 22:35.050
Wait, I smell immortals.

374
22:39.200 --> 22:40.010
I'd better hide.

375
22:47.160 --> 22:47.460
Hurry!

376
22:47.790 --> 22:48.620
Qi Fengyin's over there!

377
22:49.200 --> 22:49.770
Surround him!

378
23:15.830 --> 23:16.530
Why are you

379
23:16.750 --> 23:18.090
with this devil?

380
23:18.550 --> 23:19.430
My master's soul

381
23:19.430 --> 23:20.660
is still with Qi Fengyin.

382
23:22.350 --> 23:23.700
Master Du, I...

383
24:20.880 --> 24:21.380
Yamao!

384
24:21.790 --> 24:22.460
Hao.

385
24:22.750 --> 24:23.460
I'm glad you're safe.

386
24:24.070 --> 24:24.620
Don't worry.

387
24:25.030 --> 24:25.700
Now that the sect leaders

388
24:25.750 --> 24:26.530
have surrounded Qi Fengyin,

389
24:26.580 --> 24:27.700
they won't let him get away.

390
24:28.000 --> 24:28.940
You can't kill him!

391
24:29.200 --> 24:29.770
What did you say?

392
24:32.720 --> 24:33.220
Yamao!

393
24:33.790 --> 24:34.490
Master Du!

394
24:35.200 --> 24:36.490
My master was badly wounded

395
24:36.550 --> 24:37.620
and turned into a soul crystal.

396
24:37.790 --> 24:39.050
Qi Fengyin has it now.

397
24:39.240 --> 24:40.050
Can you not attack him?

398
24:40.200 --> 24:40.770
Please!

399
24:50.350 --> 24:51.330
Even if I stop,

400
24:51.830 --> 24:52.810
the other sect leaders

401
24:52.960 --> 24:54.420
will never let Qi Fengyin go.

402
24:55.070 --> 24:55.700
Besides,

403
24:56.240 --> 24:57.940
your master once told me

404
24:58.440 --> 24:59.660
never to let him roam free.

405
25:00.510 --> 25:01.140
Master Du...

406
25:01.160 --> 25:01.810
Enough!

407
25:02.790 --> 25:04.220
I'm sure that if your master

408
25:04.680 --> 25:06.010
were in my place,

409
25:06.310 --> 25:07.380
he would put the world first

410
25:07.920 --> 25:08.460
and make

411
25:08.510 --> 25:09.490
the same choice.

412
25:35.510 --> 25:35.980
Watch out!

413
26:08.440 --> 26:09.050
Qi Fengyin!

414
26:15.350 --> 26:16.050
Qi Fengyin!

415
26:27.160 --> 26:28.700
The power she just unleashed...

416
26:29.680 --> 26:31.530
Why did it have the same source as the Saintess's?

417
26:33.110 --> 26:33.570
Yamao.

418
26:34.790 --> 26:35.330
Yamao.

419
26:36.510 --> 26:37.530
Yamao, calm down.

420
26:37.830 --> 26:38.900
How can you expect me to calm down?

421
26:45.680 --> 26:46.250
Master Du,

422
26:47.160 --> 26:48.050
I'm shortsighted.

423
26:48.750 --> 26:50.530
I don't see the bigger picture like you cultivators.

424
26:51.680 --> 26:52.490
To me,

425
26:53.200 --> 26:54.700
my master is everything.

426
26:55.200 --> 26:55.940
If you won't save him,

427
26:57.640 --> 26:58.530
I'll do it myself.

428
27:01.720 --> 27:02.250
Yamao!

429
27:23.790 --> 27:25.180
Please show her mercy, Master.

430
27:27.960 --> 27:28.940
Take her back to Mount Zhaowu.

431
27:47.030 --> 27:48.290
The morning glories have finally bloomed.

432
28:38.680 --> 28:39.220
Master,

433
28:40.260 --> 28:40.870
why did you take

434
28:40.870 --> 28:42.090
a wisp of Yamao's spiritual power?

435
28:42.960 --> 28:43.900
Much about her identity

436
28:44.320 --> 28:45.810
remains a mystery.

437
28:46.270 --> 28:47.190
I'm afraid Danshen

438
28:47.190 --> 28:48.000
kept things from me too.

439
28:49.400 --> 28:50.330
I'll tell you the reason

440
28:50.590 --> 28:51.460
once I know for sure.

441
28:51.680 --> 28:52.660
Take good care of her.

442
28:53.440 --> 28:53.980
Yes.

443
29:06.510 --> 29:08.220
I've never seen you so quiet.

444
29:09.640 --> 29:10.570
Everyone else knows you

445
29:10.960 --> 29:11.990
as High Immortal Danshen's

446
29:11.990 --> 29:12.660
obedient disciple.

447
29:13.640 --> 29:14.770
They have no idea

448
29:15.880 --> 29:17.420
how wild you can get.

449
29:59.070 --> 30:00.570
High Immortal!

450
30:04.240 --> 30:05.180
High Immortal,

451
30:07.030 --> 30:09.380
I don't feel at home on Mount Zhaowu.

452
30:10.000 --> 30:11.010
I don't like

453
30:11.160 --> 30:13.180
all the rules here either.

454
30:14.550 --> 30:15.700
High Immortal Danshen,

455
30:17.000 --> 30:20.090
please don't leave me here.

456
30:25.440 --> 30:26.180
I should've thought of that.

457
30:26.790 --> 30:27.900
I'll take you back to Luoshen Valley

458
30:28.200 --> 30:29.050
and make you my disciple.

459
30:29.440 --> 30:30.180
Would you like that?

460
30:49.400 --> 30:50.460
Yamao.

461
30:53.550 --> 30:54.220
Where are you going?

462
30:54.440 --> 30:55.380
To find Qi Fengyin.

463
30:55.830 --> 30:56.530
You're wounded.

464
30:56.830 --> 30:57.460
You need rest.

465
30:57.790 --> 30:59.140
Stay at Mount Zhaowu until you recover.

466
31:00.110 --> 31:01.220
What wounds?

467
31:01.720 --> 31:02.900
Qi Fengyin's the one who's hurt,

468
31:03.070 --> 31:04.330
and my master's caught up in this.

469
31:04.720 --> 31:06.050
Why bring me back here instead of saving

470
31:06.310 --> 31:07.380
the one in the greatest danger?

471
31:09.200 --> 31:10.660
Master told me to look after you.

472
31:10.880 --> 31:12.180
You're not to leave Mount Zhaowu.

473
31:13.160 --> 31:13.770
My master just

474
31:13.790 --> 31:14.860
doesn't want you throwing your life away.

475
31:15.200 --> 31:16.180
Disciples from every sect

476
31:16.310 --> 31:17.660
are searching for Qi Fengyin now.

477
31:18.270 --> 31:19.140
They'll bring you

478
31:19.160 --> 31:20.180
High Immortal Danshen's spirit.

479
31:21.830 --> 31:22.570
Hao,

480
31:23.000 --> 31:24.330
will you come with me

481
31:24.350 --> 31:25.250
to find Qi Fengyin?

482
31:33.480 --> 31:34.140
Fine.

483
31:35.750 --> 31:36.790
If you insist on keeping

484
31:36.790 --> 31:37.890
a nuisance like me

485
31:37.890 --> 31:38.530
here,

486
31:39.510 --> 31:40.660
I'll hang myself right here

487
31:40.960 --> 31:42.620
and taint all the spiritual energy here.

488
31:43.070 --> 31:43.730
I'll tell everyone

489
31:43.750 --> 31:44.900
how you embarrassed yourself

490
31:45.030 --> 31:46.010
at Mount Leiguan.

491
31:46.590 --> 31:48.010
I'll tell Master Du

492
31:48.350 --> 31:50.570
you used your sect's Soul Projection

493
31:51.030 --> 31:52.220
to spy on Madam Su

494
31:52.240 --> 31:53.770
having intercourse with her lover

495
31:54.200 --> 31:55.970
and even took a bath with me.

496
31:55.970 --> 31:58.100
Me, a woman. You pervert!

497
31:58.100 --> 31:58.820
Yamao!

498
32:00.000 --> 32:00.770
Don't make things up.

499
32:11.680 --> 32:13.050
My master ended up like this

500
32:14.720 --> 32:16.250
because he was protecting me.

501
32:17.680 --> 32:19.010
How could I just let him die?

502
32:35.590 --> 32:36.380
Hao,

503
32:37.550 --> 32:38.980
I know you cultivators seek immortality

504
32:39.000 --> 32:39.860
and enlightenment.

505
32:40.160 --> 32:41.420
You seek a higher path.

506
32:42.880 --> 32:43.700
But I want little.

507
32:44.830 --> 32:45.810
All I want

508
32:46.640 --> 32:48.050
is to live out my days in peace

509
32:48.510 --> 32:49.700
with my master.

510
32:54.920 --> 32:55.860
I'm begging you.

511
32:57.440 --> 32:58.700
Please go to Master Du

512
32:58.960 --> 33:00.180
and ask him to save my master.

513
33:00.640 --> 33:01.330
Will you?

514
33:09.030 --> 33:10.180
I'll go ask Master for permission

515
33:10.590 --> 33:11.700
to leave the mountain and save him.

516
33:12.310 --> 33:13.090
But promise me

517
33:13.680 --> 33:14.730
you'll get some rest in the meantime

518
33:15.270 --> 33:16.050
and stop causing trouble.

519
33:16.310 --> 33:17.730
All right. I promise.

520
33:29.380 --> 33:30.120
Has all that cultivation

521
33:30.120 --> 33:31.370
turned him into a blockhead?

522
33:31.640 --> 33:32.570
How can he be so gullible?

523
33:32.790 --> 33:33.700
What do you know?

524
33:35.200 --> 33:37.010
It's called a carrot-and-stick approach.

525
33:39.590 --> 33:40.380
Don't be so sure

526
33:40.440 --> 33:41.460
it's that simple.

527
33:41.750 --> 33:42.770
While you were unconscious,

528
33:42.920 --> 33:44.050
that old sect leader

529
33:44.070 --> 33:45.250
took some of your spiritual power.

530
33:45.440 --> 33:46.180
Who knows

531
33:46.200 --> 33:47.420
what he's plotting?

532
34:15.190 --> 34:16.210
I was right.

533
34:16.960 --> 34:18.010
Her spiritual power

534
34:18.510 --> 34:20.460
comes from the same source as the Saintess's divine power.

535
34:22.760 --> 34:23.210
Master,

536
34:24.000 --> 34:24.820
I have something to report.

537
34:25.150 --> 34:25.610
Hao,

538
34:26.360 --> 34:27.530
I finally understand

539
34:28.510 --> 34:29.490
why

540
34:30.030 --> 34:31.090
all my attempts

541
34:31.630 --> 34:33.260
to awaken the Saintess's spirit

542
34:33.590 --> 34:35.420
have failed.

543
34:35.510 --> 34:37.380
You've figured it out, Master?

544
34:37.760 --> 34:39.090
A wisp of her divine power

545
34:39.110 --> 34:39.820
is still out there.

546
34:40.760 --> 34:41.980
Without it, I can't awaken

547
34:42.110 --> 34:42.940
the Saintess of the Tides.

548
34:44.400 --> 34:45.010
Do you know

549
34:46.510 --> 34:48.340
why Yamao's spirit essence and herb core

550
34:48.880 --> 34:51.300
can cure any illness and restore flesh to bare bones?

551
34:51.710 --> 34:53.050
Because she's a Moonlit Revival...

552
34:57.760 --> 34:58.780
You mean

553
34:59.510 --> 35:01.170
that wisp of divine power

554
35:02.190 --> 35:03.490
was absorbed by Yamao?

555
35:03.960 --> 35:05.300
If I hadn't seen Yamao lose control

556
35:05.840 --> 35:06.650
of her spiritual power

557
35:06.710 --> 35:07.860
at the cliff today,

558
35:08.400 --> 35:09.090
I'm afraid

559
35:09.670 --> 35:12.490
I would've been kept in the dark by Danshen forever.

560
35:14.920 --> 35:16.130
She was a mystical herb

561
35:16.360 --> 35:17.610
growing beside the shrine.

562
35:18.000 --> 35:19.300
Perhaps by some twist of fate,

563
35:19.590 --> 35:21.260
she absorbed a wisp of the Saintess's divine power

564
35:21.550 --> 35:22.380
and thus took human form.

565
35:23.070 --> 35:25.210
Now the world is on the brink of ruin.

566
35:25.440 --> 35:27.380
To stop Qi Fengyin from becoming the Devil Incarnate,

567
35:28.230 --> 35:30.460
we must cut out Yamao's herb core

568
35:31.110 --> 35:32.820
and return that wisp of divine power.

569
35:33.400 --> 35:36.210
Only then can we awaken the Saintess of the Tides.

570
35:44.590 --> 35:45.780
Run!

571
35:52.230 --> 35:53.740
Good thing I kept my wits about me

572
35:54.070 --> 35:55.170
and secretly followed Yuwen Hao

573
35:55.360 --> 35:56.900
to hear what he and his master were plotting.

574
35:57.510 --> 35:59.130
Otherwise, we'd both

575
35:59.230 --> 36:00.650
have died in that wretched place today.

576
36:01.280 --> 36:02.820
It's unbelievable.

577
36:03.030 --> 36:04.570
You actually took human form

578
36:04.590 --> 36:05.490
because of the Saintess of the Tides.

579
36:05.840 --> 36:06.570
So my master

580
36:06.570 --> 36:07.820
knew it all along.

581
36:08.150 --> 36:09.780
But he never considered sacrificing me.

582
36:10.230 --> 36:11.780
He even risked his life to protect me.

583
36:12.550 --> 36:13.460
What good does that do now?

584
36:13.710 --> 36:14.940
They've found out who you are.

585
36:15.110 --> 36:16.780
Even if you've escaped for now,

586
36:16.920 --> 36:17.650
it won't be long

587
36:17.840 --> 36:19.210
before every sect, great and small,

588
36:19.230 --> 36:20.300
hears the news.

589
36:20.800 --> 36:22.300
None of them will spare you then.

590
36:22.590 --> 36:23.860
Who can you turn to then?

591
36:24.880 --> 36:25.610
The immortal sects

592
36:25.960 --> 36:26.980
I trusted

593
36:27.000 --> 36:27.900
and counted on for help

594
36:28.110 --> 36:29.300
all want me dead.

595
36:29.880 --> 36:30.570
The devil I feared,

596
36:30.960 --> 36:32.380
the one everyone wants dead,

597
36:32.880 --> 36:33.940
is now the only one in the world

598
36:33.960 --> 36:35.340
who wants me alive.

599
36:37.760 --> 36:38.740
How ironic.

600
36:40.670 --> 36:41.130
In any case,

601
36:41.320 --> 36:42.130
we need to find

602
36:42.150 --> 36:42.900
Qi Fengyin first.

603
36:45.960 --> 36:46.380
Huh?

604
36:46.550 --> 36:47.420
I have no powers by day.

605
36:47.670 --> 36:48.330
You'll fly the sword.

606
36:48.590 --> 36:49.860
With what little demonic power I have,

607
36:49.860 --> 36:50.900
how am I supposed to fly it?

608
36:51.150 --> 36:51.940
Keep stalling,

609
36:51.960 --> 36:52.860
and they'll catch up to us!

610
37:06.710 --> 37:07.610
Hold this for me.

611
37:07.670 --> 37:08.090
All right.

612
37:08.110 --> 37:08.780
Thanks.

613
37:30.840 --> 37:31.300
Come on.

614
37:37.320 --> 37:38.130
I did it!

615
37:38.550 --> 37:39.530
Let's get moving.

616
37:41.510 --> 37:41.860
Fly.

617
38:20.960 --> 38:21.940
Honey, you're awake.

618
38:25.840 --> 38:26.820
You must be thirsty.

619
38:27.480 --> 38:28.210
You've been unconscious so long.

620
38:28.280 --> 38:29.380
You must be feeling awful.

621
38:29.510 --> 38:30.530
I'll get you some water.

622
38:46.150 --> 38:47.820
A wisp of malice is hidden here.

623
38:48.550 --> 38:49.980
That compass really does work.

624
38:55.030 --> 38:56.090
Such a strong demonic aura.

625
38:57.070 --> 38:58.340
It blankets this whole place,

626
38:58.710 --> 38:59.860
masking all other auras.

627
39:00.880 --> 39:01.380
That means

628
39:02.070 --> 39:02.940
I can't sense

629
39:03.280 --> 39:04.460
where the wisp of malice is.

630
39:09.000 --> 39:09.610
Honey,

631
39:09.920 --> 39:11.170
what are you doing out here?

632
39:14.920 --> 39:16.050
Mr. Cheng, you're back?

633
39:17.000 --> 39:18.260
Congratulations, Xiangyuan.

634
39:19.550 --> 39:21.300
I'd waited so long for him to come home.

635
39:22.190 --> 39:22.690
Let's go.

636
39:26.510 --> 39:27.050
Honey,

637
39:27.280 --> 39:28.340
it's getting late.

638
39:28.400 --> 39:29.570
Let's go home and get some rest.

639
39:30.400 --> 39:30.940
Let's go.

640
39:31.960 --> 39:32.340
Come on.

641
39:36.800 --> 39:38.460
If I rest a little longer,

642
39:39.190 --> 39:40.860
I may be able to overpower the Wanjun Lock again,

643
39:41.360 --> 39:42.740
dispel the demonic aura here,

644
39:43.250 --> 39:44.210
and reclaim my malice.

645
39:44.340 --> 39:45.730
Qi Fengyin!

646
39:50.550 --> 39:51.690
I wonder how she's doing.

647
40:09.670 --> 40:11.160
I never should've trusted you!

648
40:11.440 --> 40:12.780
You just had to make me fly the sword.

649
40:13.000 --> 40:13.780
Now look what happened.

650
40:13.920 --> 40:14.900
We nearly fell to our deaths.

651
40:15.480 --> 40:16.820
If Mount Zhaowu's disciples find us,

652
40:17.320 --> 40:18.530
we'll be in far worse trouble.

653
40:18.960 --> 40:19.980
A fall is nothing.

654
40:21.190 --> 40:22.050
We've flown around here

655
40:22.070 --> 40:23.260
several times.

656
40:23.630 --> 40:24.420
Are you sure

657
40:24.420 --> 40:25.690
His Lordship fell here?

658
40:25.690 --> 40:27.380
The immortal sects searched here several times

659
40:27.440 --> 40:28.130
but found

660
40:28.130 --> 40:29.120
no trace of Qi Fengyin.

661
40:31.070 --> 40:31.940
Yamao,

662
40:33.230 --> 40:34.170
is His Lordship dead?

663
40:38.670 --> 40:40.340
Go on and cry. That'll help.

664
40:42.800 --> 40:43.740
Then His Lordship

665
40:43.800 --> 40:44.570
must have hidden

666
40:44.630 --> 40:45.380
his aura.

667
40:45.400 --> 40:46.610
That's why they couldn't find him.

668
40:50.320 --> 40:51.460
He'd hide from the immortal sects,

669
40:51.920 --> 40:53.090
but he wouldn't hide from us.

670
40:53.760 --> 40:55.530
He's hurt, so he can't have gone far.

671
40:55.760 --> 40:56.980
Let's search along the river.

672
40:59.840 --> 41:00.530
Yamao?

673
41:02.760 --> 41:03.460
Are you feeling unwell

674
41:03.510 --> 41:04.570
because Du Zhong took a wisp

675
41:04.760 --> 41:05.740
of your spiritual power?

676
41:06.190 --> 41:07.460
I probably just feel dizzy because I

677
41:07.880 --> 41:08.740
haven't slept today.

678
41:09.550 --> 41:10.420
Let's find him first.

679
41:38.670 --> 41:39.570
Yamao,

680
41:40.110 --> 41:41.650
what's wrong with this place?

681
41:41.800 --> 41:42.650
Out here in the wilderness,

682
41:43.110 --> 41:44.260
they're probably hunters' traps.

683
41:46.440 --> 41:47.210
Why don't we wait

684
41:47.590 --> 41:49.380
until your spiritual power returns tonight

685
41:49.510 --> 41:50.300
before moving on?

686
41:50.630 --> 41:51.570
If we don't hurry,

687
41:51.710 --> 41:52.460
Qi Fengyin

688
41:52.480 --> 41:53.940
might get eaten alive by some wild beast.

689
41:55.280 --> 41:55.780
Wait!

690
41:56.190 --> 41:57.170
I don't want to end up

691
41:57.190 --> 41:58.170
full of holes.

692
41:58.670 --> 41:59.170
Tell you what.

693
41:59.590 --> 42:00.780
Tell me once you find

694
42:00.880 --> 42:01.340
His Lordship.

695
42:01.550 --> 42:02.050
I'll hide for now.

696
42:02.320 --> 42:02.740
You...

697
42:14.190 --> 42:14.740
Hao,

698
42:15.320 --> 42:17.050
go down the mountain and find that girl at once.

699
42:17.480 --> 42:19.610
When you find her, don't waste time talking.

700
42:20.000 --> 42:21.740
Just take her herb core and bring it back.

701
42:26.800 --> 42:27.820
What am I doing?

702
42:28.760 --> 42:30.050
Master ordered me to take her herb core.

703
42:30.920 --> 42:32.130
Why did I save her?

704
42:36.110 --> 42:36.900
She's no innocent.

705
42:37.960 --> 42:39.300
If I keep hesitating,

706
42:40.590 --> 42:41.650
it could lead to disaster.

707
42:50.400 --> 42:51.810
Who'd have thought there'd be a village

708
42:52.030 --> 42:53.180
this deep in the mountains?

709
43:03.190 --> 43:03.920
Hao,

710
43:04.070 --> 43:04.930
I knew it was you.

711
43:13.190 --> 43:14.130
Someone secretly saved me

712
43:14.400 --> 43:15.460
from all those traps.

713
43:15.550 --> 43:16.690
I knew it had to be you.

714
43:18.800 --> 43:19.260
You...

715
43:23.190 --> 43:24.050
Hao,

716
43:24.670 --> 43:25.730
are you angry with me for leaving

717
43:25.750 --> 43:26.500
without saying goodbye?

718
43:27.920 --> 43:28.420
Oh, right.

719
43:28.880 --> 43:30.250
I picked some fruit earlier.

720
43:30.440 --> 43:32.180
Think of it as my apology.

721
43:41.550 --> 43:42.980
You can drop the act, Yamao.

722
43:47.630 --> 43:48.530
I know

723
43:49.070 --> 43:50.250
exactly what you're like.

724
43:50.550 --> 43:51.900
Are you determined to kill me?

725
43:52.400 --> 43:53.820
So you've learned the truth.

726
43:54.400 --> 43:55.460
Before my master passed out,

727
43:56.190 --> 43:57.460
he told me to seek refuge at Mount Zhaowu.

728
43:58.040 --> 43:59.170
He said you'd protect me.

729
43:59.590 --> 44:00.300
But it turns out

730
44:00.550 --> 44:02.210
you're no different from Su Hexiang.

731
44:02.690 --> 44:03.820
You just want my herb core.

732
44:03.930 --> 44:05.610
Madam Su acted out of selfish desire.

733
44:06.320 --> 44:07.420
Mount Zhaowu is different.

734
44:08.400 --> 44:09.940
If you couldn't awaken the Saintess of the Tides

735
44:10.590 --> 44:11.610
and stop the Devil Incarnate's return,

736
44:12.920 --> 44:14.690
we'd never lay a finger on you.

737
44:36.880 --> 44:37.860
But if we take her herb core,

738
44:38.550 --> 44:39.860
Yamao will die.

739
44:40.520 --> 44:41.610
She hasn't done anything wrong.

740
44:42.190 --> 44:43.130
Right or wrong is beside the point.

741
44:43.880 --> 44:44.980
As a cultivator,

742
44:45.230 --> 44:45.900
you should know

743
44:46.270 --> 44:48.690
it's our duty to keep the world at peace.

744
44:49.070 --> 44:49.610
Hao,

745
44:50.630 --> 44:52.340
it's time to prove your commitment.

746
45:06.040 --> 45:06.820
Yamao,

747
45:12.040 --> 45:13.020
I can't disobey my master.

748
46:25.920 --> 46:27.090
- Beat him to death! - Kill him!

749
46:27.110 --> 46:28.900
You must be my cousin's wife.

750
46:29.040 --> 46:29.940
I'm Yamao,

751
46:29.960 --> 46:32.040
his distant cousin.

752
46:32.150 --> 46:33.560
My husband and I

753
46:34.000 --> 46:35.130
thought we'd pay you a visit.

754
46:35.800 --> 46:36.570
Something's coming.

755
46:36.920 --> 46:37.690
They're clearly human,

756
46:37.800 --> 46:38.940
so why do they give off such a ghostly aura?

757
46:39.070 --> 46:40.570
You two, stay close to me.

758
47:04.700 --> 47:08.740
♪See this world where flowers have yet to bloom♪

759
47:08.980 --> 47:12.420
♪So many longings♪

760
47:13.100 --> 47:15.180
♪Linger in the web of fate♪

761
47:15.380 --> 47:20.380
♪Then vanish like mist in a moment♪

762
47:21.300 --> 47:25.340
♪Before seas turn to fields♪

763
47:25.580 --> 47:29.020
♪Dreams scatter across the sky♪

764
47:29.700 --> 47:31.780
♪One look into each other's eyes♪

765
47:31.980 --> 47:39.380
♪And we fall in love in an instant♪

766
47:40.780 --> 47:44.460
♪When a hundred thousand blossoms have withered♪

767
47:44.700 --> 47:48.380
♪I'll still want to stay with you like this forever♪

768
47:49.020 --> 47:52.580
♪The wish we made in the long night♪

769
47:52.900 --> 47:57.060
♪Still waits to come true♪

770
47:57.300 --> 48:00.980
♪However many hardships this vast world holds♪

771
48:01.540 --> 48:05.180
♪I'll stay by your side♪

772
48:05.660 --> 48:09.260
♪Love will grace our days till the end of time♪

773
48:09.500 --> 48:16.820
♪When the dream ends, we'll have no regrets♪

774
